# Chronicle needs no environment variables and no secrets to run.
#
# The app is local-first: there is no server, no database URL and no API key
# in the build. AI assistance (opt-in) takes its endpoint and model from
# Settings at runtime, and the API key is entered per session and kept in
# memory only — it is never written to disk, storage or exports.
#
# This file exists so that nobody adds a real .env "for convenience".
